                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomonini gaari fardi hirkisu ka kuma tokofi d'ibba afuritiifi fardoole askartini yaabatu, ta kuma kud'ani lama, wolti guure. Haga toko Yerusalemuti galche, kaani dira d'ibiti gargari qoode. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
